  "prefLabel": "Adm 604.10 Agreements Relative to Multi-Agency Services Originating with Requests for Proposals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 604.10 Agreements Relative to Multi-Agency Services Originating with Requests for Proposals. In the case of service contracts involving services to more than one agency that originated with a request for proposal:\n\n(a) The division shall recommend to the commissioner a vendor according to the procedures set forth in Adm 606; and\n\n(b) In the event that a bidder submitting a service contract proposal under Adm 604.09 is selected to provide services, the bidder shall execute such standard contract terms as designated by the department of justice.\n\nSource. #8310, eff 5-11-05; ss by #10364, eff 7-1-13 (from Adm 604.11); ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (formerly Adm 604.09) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
